  _recipeBookDescriptionUnspoiled: 'A hearty bowl of grilled ratenudel is the perfect
    meal to give you enough energy to rebuild the country! The doughy and bouncy
    texture is so close to its ''inspiration'' that some stores add the real thing,
    a popular regional variation. '
  _recipeBookDescriptionSpoiled: "\"A miracle! The blend of meat and cheese has somehow
    rearranged itself back to actual rat tails!\" an apothecary exclaimed as he peered
    into the bowl, watching the writhing mass lurch.  \r\n\r\n\u201CThe meat now
    acts like muscle fibers and the cheese as sinew. Now, it\u2019s easy to pick
    off the real rat tails since those are the only ones not moving!\u201D\r\n"
